WEBVTT

01:54.040 --> 01:55.160
Big bags?

01:57.280 --> 01:58.160
There aren't big bags.

01:59.120 --> 02:00.680
Big bags, big bags…

02:00.760 --> 02:06.760
OUTDOOR PRODUCTS SPECIAL PRICE AREA

02:08.479 --> 02:10.919
Excuse me. Do you have any big bags?

02:11.000 --> 02:14.800
Something sturdy.
A bag big enough to fit a person.

02:15.800 --> 02:16.840
Over there.

02:17.720 --> 02:18.760
Thank you.

02:28.680 --> 02:29.760
LAUNDRY SECTION

03:05.920 --> 03:06.760
What's going on?

03:08.440 --> 03:09.640
Don't move.

03:09.720 --> 03:10.880
What if it gets crushed?

03:10.960 --> 03:12.760
Will they make us pay for it?

03:14.200 --> 03:15.560
Don't panic.

03:16.360 --> 03:17.640
I'll buy the damaged candy.

03:17.720 --> 03:19.960
Can you help me get a cart to load it?

03:20.040 --> 03:21.200
Sure.

03:22.480 --> 03:24.800
Take your time. I'm not in a hurry.

03:24.880 --> 03:26.120
Use this cart.

03:26.200 --> 03:27.320
Thanks.

03:28.960 --> 03:30.160
It's you again.

03:31.840 --> 03:32.720
It's me again.

03:32.800 --> 03:34.400
I can't do it.

03:35.040 --> 03:36.960
It's not possible, absolutely not.

03:37.800 --> 03:38.640
It's not possible.

03:40.640 --> 03:41.880
- No.
- Do you need help?

03:41.960 --> 03:42.760
Yes.

03:54.520 --> 03:56.000
- Thank you.
- My pleasure.

03:56.080 --> 03:58.160
Thank you. I'll treat you to some candy.

04:01.560 --> 04:02.720
Your pants are torn.

04:05.360 --> 04:07.280
Torn? How?

04:08.240 --> 04:10.240
Here, cover it up.

04:12.360 --> 04:13.880
Thanks.

04:13.960 --> 04:17.560
No need. Every time you meet me,
it seems like you're unlucky.

04:19.440 --> 04:21.240
Seems like it.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.880
B2

04:49.280 --> 04:50.680
Everything's ready.

04:51.840 --> 04:53.960
Everyone, focus on teamwork and be quick.

04:54.720 --> 04:56.000
Don't cause unnecessary complications.

04:56.080 --> 04:58.080
I'll wait for the right time to move.

04:58.160 --> 04:59.600
I won't let Tang Qi suffer too much.

05:00.200 --> 05:01.320
Get ready to move.

06:31.200 --> 06:32.440
I…

06:35.880 --> 06:36.760
I thought

06:38.600 --> 06:39.640
you weren't going to show up.

06:41.120 --> 06:41.960
Why?

06:45.480 --> 06:46.360
This place

06:46.880 --> 06:48.320
is so remote and desolate.

06:49.840 --> 06:51.760
I thought it was just a prank.

06:53.240 --> 06:55.800
Sorry, I was narrow-minded.

06:58.920 --> 07:00.480
I brought you a gift.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.760
A gift for me?

07:06.080 --> 07:07.000
Let's set off some fireworks together.

07:08.600 --> 07:09.840
Fireworks?

07:10.600 --> 07:11.760
Now?

07:13.080 --> 07:13.960
Well…

07:16.160 --> 07:18.160
Why not until evening to light them?

07:18.680 --> 07:21.040
It's daytime.
We won't be able to see anything.

07:21.120 --> 07:23.240
No, I can't wait.

07:23.320 --> 07:24.400
I want to do it now.

07:25.920 --> 07:28.120
OK, let's do it now.

07:43.160 --> 07:45.240
The fireworks are beautiful.

07:46.080 --> 07:47.320
They're so beautiful.

07:48.160 --> 07:51.320
Are you sure they look good
during the day?

07:57.400 --> 07:58.480
Just imagine.

07:58.560 --> 08:01.440
We can imagine
the fireworks blooming beautifully.

08:03.480 --> 08:04.960
Come on. Close your eyes.

08:06.480 --> 08:08.360
Let's imagine together.

08:13.320 --> 08:16.400
- Close your eyes.
- Come on. Close your eyes.

08:21.480 --> 08:25.280
We're walking on a lush green meadow,

08:26.880 --> 08:29.920
with no city noise or clamor.

08:30.440 --> 08:31.840
Only the two of us.

08:33.400 --> 08:37.159
We walk through the meadow
and see some flowers.

09:06.080 --> 09:07.560
In the air--

09:07.640 --> 09:09.080
I think I hear the sound of water.

09:18.320 --> 09:19.400
We…

09:20.680 --> 09:23.160
We continue through the flowers,

09:23.840 --> 09:26.040
come to a riverbank, and board a boat.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.600
The boat stops in the middle of the river.

09:29.440 --> 09:33.400
The water flows gently.
The stars are bright above.

09:37.760 --> 09:38.800
Suddenly…

09:39.560 --> 09:42.920
Boom! The fireworks explode.

09:43.000 --> 09:46.440
Tiny sparks shine like gold,

09:46.960 --> 09:51.680
falling into the lake.

10:17.440 --> 10:19.600
The natural environment here is amazing.

10:19.680 --> 10:23.440
All kinds of small animals appear,
living carefree.

10:45.480 --> 10:46.640
You…

10:50.120 --> 10:50.960
You…

11:01.080 --> 11:02.320
Stop!

11:07.120 --> 11:08.560
Why do you keep hitting me?

11:08.640 --> 11:09.480
Don't move.

11:12.640 --> 11:15.480
There's a funnel-web spider here,
highly poisonous.

11:15.560 --> 11:17.960
If bitten, within ten minutes,

11:19.040 --> 11:22.160
you'll experience nausea,
vomiting, muscle spasms,

11:22.240 --> 11:24.000
and possibly die from suffocation.

11:25.280 --> 11:26.800
Don't move.

11:26.880 --> 11:29.400
It's probably nearby, very dangerous.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.480
Let me check.

11:42.520 --> 11:43.640
SU MIAO! SU MIAO!

11:46.760 --> 11:47.920
SU MIAO!

11:50.800 --> 11:52.040
Poisonous spider?

11:52.800 --> 11:55.480
Where? Where is it?

11:56.080 --> 11:57.480
Where is it? Where?

11:58.200 --> 11:59.360
Where's the poisonous spider?

12:01.480 --> 12:03.240
Your hand… Put your hand down.

12:03.320 --> 12:04.320
There's no spider anymore.

12:04.400 --> 12:05.320
None.

12:12.320 --> 12:13.480
Thank you so much.

12:14.080 --> 12:15.520
You knew the spider was poisonous,

12:15.600 --> 12:17.440
but still fought it off
with your bare hands.

12:18.200 --> 12:19.720
Your safety is the most important.

12:22.080 --> 12:23.200
Don't worry.

12:23.920 --> 12:27.080
If it bites the neck, it's fatal.

12:28.080 --> 12:29.280
If it's just the hand,

12:29.920 --> 12:31.280
maybe there's still hope.

12:51.280 --> 12:52.800
It's getting a bit chilly.

12:52.880 --> 12:53.760
Should I take you home?

12:54.640 --> 12:55.600
No need.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.400
It's rare for me to go out.
I want to play a little longer.

12:59.240 --> 13:01.000
But you look cold.

13:01.080 --> 13:03.320
- What if you catch a cold?
- I won't.

13:03.400 --> 13:05.080
I'm in great health.

13:06.560 --> 13:08.040
Are you sure you're not cold?

13:11.120 --> 13:11.960
Yes.

13:18.960 --> 13:20.360
If you want to keep playing, go ahead.

13:20.440 --> 13:22.480
But wear a coat for that.

13:28.720 --> 13:30.240
What's wrong? Do you feel unwell?

13:31.960 --> 13:33.600
No. No need.

13:34.520 --> 13:35.360
I'm not cold.

13:37.320 --> 13:39.680
Let's go over there and enjoy the view.

13:43.640 --> 13:44.720
So beautiful.

13:45.240 --> 13:47.040
Even the air seems beautiful.

13:50.920 --> 13:52.680
Look.

13:52.760 --> 13:54.040
A daytime meteor.

13:57.360 --> 13:59.120
It really is a daytime meteor.

14:02.680 --> 14:05.440
- It looks like fireworks.
- No.

14:06.760 --> 14:07.840
It's definitely a meteor.

14:07.920 --> 14:10.680
You don't think meteors
only appear at night, do you?

14:11.280 --> 14:13.720
Let me tell you.
Meteors can appear both day and night.

14:17.240 --> 14:18.480
I believe it.

14:19.800 --> 14:23.320
The meteor is caused by the meteoroid
crossing the atmosphere

14:23.400 --> 14:25.680
and electronic transition
creating a trail.

14:26.680 --> 14:28.400
Every year, 5,000 tons
of meteorites fall to Earth.

14:59.360 --> 15:01.960
Why is Tang Qi so quick?

15:02.560 --> 15:03.920
It must be the power of love.

15:07.800 --> 15:09.720
Su Miao, are you okay?

15:09.800 --> 15:11.320
Are you hurt?

15:28.960 --> 15:29.960
DAYTIME METEOR!

15:35.480 --> 15:36.320
SU MIAO! SU MIAO!

15:38.440 --> 15:40.560
Let go of me!

15:51.720 --> 15:53.560
Why did you suddenly hug me and roll down?

15:54.160 --> 15:55.880
- I…
- Why?

15:56.720 --> 15:59.080
I think I saw a meteor flying towards you.

16:01.440 --> 16:02.760
But…

16:04.760 --> 16:05.680
I must have been mistaken.

16:09.520 --> 16:12.360
Are you saying I almost got hit
by a meteorite?

16:13.040 --> 16:15.600
You're really ridiculous.
Your ridiculousness is off the charts!

16:16.920 --> 16:19.880
Though the chance of a meteorite
hitting someone is small,

16:19.960 --> 16:21.360
historical records show

16:21.440 --> 16:23.720
that in 1888, 1954, and 2011,

16:23.800 --> 16:26.520
there were cases
of meteorites killing people.

16:28.120 --> 16:29.720
You really are well-read.

16:29.800 --> 16:31.080
If you had read fewer books,

16:31.160 --> 16:33.000
you wouldn't believe
in such a ridiculous thing.

16:35.120 --> 16:37.520
Sorry, I was mistaken.

16:39.720 --> 16:40.720
It's okay.

16:41.920 --> 16:42.760
I forgive you.

16:42.840 --> 16:45.200
Let's keep playing.

16:45.800 --> 16:47.040
Still?

16:49.080 --> 16:51.560
It's getting dark. We should head back.

16:51.640 --> 16:54.720
No, I still want to play. I can't leave.

16:54.800 --> 16:55.880
I want to keep playing.

16:58.880 --> 17:00.400
Looks like it might rain.

17:00.480 --> 17:02.200
How about we come back next time?

17:02.280 --> 17:04.880
I promise. I'll definitely
come with you next time.

17:05.640 --> 17:07.240
Can you take a picture
for me as a keepsake?

17:08.960 --> 17:10.400
We'll go back after it's over.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.079
OK.

17:18.640 --> 17:20.760
- Come on.
- Stand a little farther back.

17:21.440 --> 17:22.359
I want the full view.

17:22.440 --> 17:25.359
I want to capture the whole scenery
in the photo as a memory.

17:26.280 --> 17:27.319
OK.

17:29.840 --> 17:30.760
A little farther back.

17:30.840 --> 17:32.360
- Farther back?
- Yes.

17:36.000 --> 17:38.320
Farther back. A little farther back.

17:38.400 --> 17:39.680
No, I can't see you if I continue.

17:40.280 --> 17:42.040
It doesn't matter.
What's important is the view.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.280
A little more.

17:43.360 --> 17:44.320
Just a bit more.

17:44.400 --> 17:45.400
OK.

17:53.800 --> 17:56.160
Got it. Shall we head back now?

17:56.960 --> 17:57.920
Let's take one more.

17:58.600 --> 17:59.640
OK.

18:03.480 --> 18:05.040
One more shot.

18:10.840 --> 18:11.920
One more shot.

18:12.760 --> 18:14.800
- What?
- One more shot.

18:18.280 --> 18:20.800
One more shot. One more shot.

18:20.880 --> 18:23.400
One more. One more.

18:54.880 --> 18:55.960
Su Miao!

19:31.800 --> 19:33.120
Tang Qi.

19:33.200 --> 19:34.360
I…

19:36.240 --> 19:37.640
Tang Qi.

19:38.760 --> 19:40.280
Tang Qi.

19:45.400 --> 19:46.240
I…

19:50.640 --> 19:53.160
Tang Qi. Tang Qi.

19:55.680 --> 19:57.800
Is he dead?

20:12.080 --> 20:13.520
He just fainted.

20:17.720 --> 20:19.760
Tang Qi is too easily frightened.

20:34.560 --> 20:36.120
As a tetrachromat,

20:36.720 --> 20:40.600
Tang's eyes are naturally
more sensitive than others.

20:41.120 --> 20:42.880
When faced with excessive stimulation,

20:42.960 --> 20:45.680
his brain activated
its self-protection mechanism,

20:45.760 --> 20:47.000
causing him to faint.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.560
How are his eyes now?

20:51.320 --> 20:52.640
We've done a full check-up,

20:53.200 --> 20:54.280
and no issues were found.

20:54.840 --> 20:56.440
But once he wakes up,

20:56.520 --> 20:59.040
we'll do further checks to confirm.

21:00.120 --> 21:02.640
He needs to rest more for now.

21:02.720 --> 21:04.680
His eyes can't be overstimulated again.

21:05.720 --> 21:06.880
Alright, Doctor.

21:06.960 --> 21:08.280
We'll make sure he gets enough rest.

21:10.400 --> 21:14.560
Also, Tang's condition
is like color blindness.

21:15.160 --> 21:17.560
It's incurable and will last a lifetime.

21:18.360 --> 21:21.560
So, he needs to be extra careful.

21:21.640 --> 21:24.000
Precautions are more important
than treatment.

21:25.560 --> 21:27.240
Sure, we'll keep an eye on him.

21:28.760 --> 21:29.920
Let him rest.

21:49.240 --> 21:51.000
Tang, you're awake.

22:03.720 --> 22:05.880
Su Miao. Su Miao.

22:05.960 --> 22:07.240
Tang.

22:13.320 --> 22:14.360
How do you feel?

22:19.240 --> 22:20.080
Where's Su Miao?

22:22.280 --> 22:24.440
It must be my eyes acting up again.

22:24.520 --> 22:26.280
I thought I saw her

22:28.720 --> 22:30.320
struck by lightning.

22:35.960 --> 22:37.920
Did my condition scare Su Miao?

22:41.120 --> 22:42.320
I need to apologize to her.

22:42.920 --> 22:44.920
Tang. Tang.

22:46.240 --> 22:47.320
Your eyes were acting up,

22:48.880 --> 22:50.240
but it only caused you to faint.

22:51.040 --> 22:53.040
What you saw wasn't a hallucination.

22:56.320 --> 22:57.360
Su Miao…

22:58.920 --> 22:59.760
She's really dead.

23:08.160 --> 23:09.280
No way.

23:12.720 --> 23:14.440
You've studied statistics.

23:16.240 --> 23:18.080
You know the chance
of being struck by lightning.

23:19.640 --> 23:21.800
It's one in 1.75 million,

23:21.880 --> 23:24.960
and 82% of victims are male.

23:26.240 --> 23:27.440
How could this happen?

23:34.360 --> 23:35.960
Is Gu Yu playing another prank on me?

23:36.040 --> 23:38.600
- He's really getting worse with age.
- Tang.

23:43.080 --> 23:44.320
Su Miao…

23:45.920 --> 23:47.240
She really is dead.

24:06.360 --> 24:07.400
Tang.

24:17.720 --> 24:19.760
Calm down.

24:19.840 --> 24:21.040
Don't get so worked up.

24:21.760 --> 24:22.800
Tang.

24:24.080 --> 24:26.000
Gu Yu, quick! Don't get worked up.

24:46.840 --> 24:52.400
SOMBER MOURNING

24:53.160 --> 24:56.840
When someone dies,
everything should end, right?

24:56.920 --> 24:59.360
Why do you have to offer
"after-sales service"?

24:59.440 --> 25:01.480
I can't help it.

25:01.560 --> 25:03.560
Not only does Tang Qi
want to mourn Su Miao,

25:03.640 --> 25:05.840
but even Mr. Zhou and Mr. Gu
said they want to say goodbye.

25:05.920 --> 25:08.920
It's like playing a murder mystery game.
We're just the NPCs.

25:09.520 --> 25:11.120
Just be sad and cry a little.

25:11.200 --> 25:12.920
If the players can't find
the clues, we'll win.

25:13.000 --> 25:15.240
I can't cry.

25:15.320 --> 25:17.360
I've prepared for this.

25:17.440 --> 25:20.280
Onion juice and ginger juice.
Compliment me.

25:20.360 --> 25:22.320
You are the smartest and the cutest.

25:24.360 --> 25:25.560
Hurry, hurry.

25:29.520 --> 25:31.480
Qingli.

25:32.120 --> 25:33.200
Take it.

25:38.800 --> 25:40.800
They're here. Hurry, hurry.

26:09.960 --> 26:13.640
DEEP MOURNING

26:39.880 --> 26:41.200
My condolences.

27:30.840 --> 27:31.920
Where's the body?

27:36.720 --> 27:38.600
I want to see Su Miao one last time.

27:52.760 --> 27:55.480
It's too tragic to look at,
so she's been cremated.

28:15.440 --> 28:16.840
It's all my fault.

28:27.280 --> 28:28.480
There was a thunderstorm.

28:30.360 --> 28:31.560
We were out in the wilderness.

28:36.120 --> 28:37.720
I should've known it was dangerous.

28:44.400 --> 28:45.520
But I…

28:47.040 --> 28:49.400
I didn't take you away sooner.

29:07.240 --> 29:08.680
I'm sorry.

29:53.480 --> 29:56.160
Congrats on our successful plan.

29:56.880 --> 29:57.920
Cheers.

30:03.600 --> 30:06.320
Tell me. Did I go too far?

30:06.400 --> 30:08.240
Tang Qi looks heartbroken.

30:09.360 --> 30:11.320
You don't seriously think
Tang Qi loved you

30:11.400 --> 30:12.800
and can't accept your death, do you?

30:13.920 --> 30:16.040
It's Su Miao, not me.

30:16.120 --> 30:17.920
How long have they known each other?

30:18.000 --> 30:20.800
Barely a month.
It's just lust at first sight.

30:20.880 --> 30:23.040
How much could he like her?

30:25.520 --> 30:26.480
Stop reading so many comics.

30:27.080 --> 30:30.400
Loving men only exist
in women's fantasies.

30:30.920 --> 30:33.880
Even if Tang Qi is sad,
it's just a passing feeling, like a cold.

30:33.960 --> 30:37.080
He'll sneeze a few times,
shed some tears, and it's over.

30:41.920 --> 30:42.840
Right.

30:43.360 --> 30:45.040
I overthought it.

30:45.720 --> 30:48.200
- Cheers, everyone.
- Cheers.

30:48.280 --> 30:50.600
Congrats on getting rid
of the "face worshiper".

30:50.680 --> 30:53.040
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

31:13.280 --> 31:15.120
Is the lady
who was with you last time late?

31:15.840 --> 31:18.440
Should I bring out the next dishes later?

31:18.520 --> 31:20.080
The innards won't taste good
if they're cold.

31:20.600 --> 31:21.480
No need.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.120
She's not late.

31:28.120 --> 31:29.240
She won't be coming.

31:32.720 --> 31:33.800
Sorry.

33:58.200 --> 34:00.160
I just heard something in the break room.

34:00.800 --> 34:03.360
- What is it?
- Mr. Tang didn't come to work today.

34:03.440 --> 34:04.680
He took a leave.

34:04.760 --> 34:06.160
Mr. Tang took a leave?

34:06.240 --> 34:08.280
He's a workaholic,
with no days off all year round.

34:08.360 --> 34:10.000
Why did Mr. Tang take leave?

34:11.280 --> 34:12.440
He said he's not feeling well.

34:14.120 --> 34:15.120
He must be really sick,

34:15.719 --> 34:17.480
or Mr. Tang wouldn't take a leave.

34:19.239 --> 34:21.080
Is it because of Su Miao's death?

34:21.600 --> 34:23.480
Is Tang Qi still dwelling on it?

34:40.679 --> 34:42.239
GENERAL OPHTHALMOLOGY CLINIC
CHEN ZHIPING, CHIEF PHYSICIAN

34:50.639 --> 34:53.199
Your eyes are more sensitive than others,

34:53.280 --> 34:54.920
and you've just been stimulated,

34:55.000 --> 34:56.199
so you need to rest and recuperate.

34:56.920 --> 34:58.880
However, you drink

34:58.960 --> 35:01.680
and eat spicy food without proper rest.
How could there be no problem?

35:02.360 --> 35:05.320
Sorry, it's our fault.
We'll pay more attention.

35:08.080 --> 35:08.920
I'll prescribe some medicine.

35:09.000 --> 35:11.320
Make sure to take it on time at home.

35:11.960 --> 35:13.800
Use the eye ointment three times a day.

35:13.880 --> 35:15.880
The oral medication contains
chlorpheniramine maleate,

35:16.720 --> 35:19.240
which will make you drowsy,
so you can rest.

35:19.320 --> 35:21.040
To avoid light sensitivity,

35:21.120 --> 35:23.560
try to stay indoors today.

35:24.680 --> 35:26.320
- Go get the medicine.
- OK.

35:27.120 --> 35:28.280
Thank you, Doctor.

35:33.640 --> 35:34.760
Thank you, Doctor.

35:38.600 --> 35:40.000
I was wrong.

35:43.480 --> 35:44.480
I wasn't wrong.

35:46.520 --> 35:47.640
I was wrong.

35:50.160 --> 35:51.880
- I wasn't wrong.
- Are you fortune-telling?

35:51.960 --> 35:53.360
What are you talking about?

35:54.640 --> 35:56.160
Tang Qi is sick.

35:56.240 --> 35:58.320
I keep thinking
that I might be wrong about this.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.600
What does that have to do with you?

36:02.720 --> 36:05.960
Though Mr. Gu's tone was vague,
and he didn't specify the illness,

36:06.040 --> 36:09.440
he did say Tang Qi wasn't feeling well
because of Su Miao.

36:10.240 --> 36:12.720
- Mr. Gu came to work?
- Yes.

36:13.760 --> 36:15.640
If Mr. Gu comes to work,

36:15.720 --> 36:17.080
it means Tang Qi
isn't in critical condition.

36:17.160 --> 36:18.320
There's no need for others to worry.

36:20.200 --> 36:21.080
Have you forgotten

36:21.160 --> 36:23.440
how Tang Qi treated you back then?

36:23.520 --> 36:25.800
He was disgusted with you
while being nice to Su Miao.

36:25.880 --> 36:29.000
This kind of superficial guy
doesn't feel deep sorrow.

36:30.440 --> 36:31.640
You make a good point.

36:33.080 --> 36:35.360
Su Miao's story
has officially come to an end.

36:35.880 --> 36:37.840
Even if Tang Qi has some emotional issues,

36:37.920 --> 36:38.800
it'll only be a side story.

36:39.520 --> 36:41.640
You shouldn't dwell on it. Turn the page.

36:41.720 --> 36:42.960
OK, I won't dwell on it.

36:43.480 --> 36:44.520
I'm turning the page.

36:58.040 --> 36:59.080
Chengcheng,

37:00.080 --> 37:02.120
are you a little reluctant
to let go of Su Miao?

37:03.160 --> 37:05.640
After all, she got a lot of things
you didn't get.

37:10.920 --> 37:13.720
Sometimes I disliked Su Miao,

37:13.800 --> 37:17.400
but I can't say I don't like to be Su Miao

37:18.240 --> 37:20.080
because everyone liked her.

37:20.160 --> 37:22.200
It feels good when being treated kindly.

37:22.720 --> 37:24.480
Pretty people sometimes say

37:24.560 --> 37:28.880
that being pretty also invites trouble.
People are prejudiced against them,

37:28.960 --> 37:30.600
thinking they're brainless,

37:30.680 --> 37:32.880
assuming they're just a vase,

37:32.960 --> 37:34.680
or thinking they only rely
on their looks to make a living.

37:35.560 --> 37:36.840
But have you ever seen

37:36.920 --> 37:38.360
a beautiful girl

37:38.440 --> 37:40.240
trying to make herself ugly?

37:40.320 --> 37:42.320
Only girls who aren't as pretty

37:42.400 --> 37:43.960
try to make themselves beautiful.

37:44.800 --> 37:46.360
But I'm fake.

37:46.440 --> 37:47.920
Even if Su Miao is my disguise,

37:48.000 --> 37:50.200
no matter how much Tang Qi likes her,

37:50.280 --> 37:51.920
it has nothing to do with me.

37:52.000 --> 37:53.920
In fact, the more he likes her,
the more ironic I feel.

37:54.000 --> 37:55.560
I understand.

38:01.360 --> 38:03.480
May Su Miao rest in peace.

38:36.880 --> 38:38.200
Ms. Lin.

38:41.000 --> 38:41.840
Here.

38:42.720 --> 38:44.120
Thank you.

38:46.680 --> 38:48.840
Did you draw the Nezha yourself?

38:50.960 --> 38:53.240
Yes. He's my boyfriend this week.

38:53.320 --> 38:55.200
Wherever I go, he accompanies me.

38:56.600 --> 38:58.320
Hello. I'm Gu Yu.

38:58.400 --> 39:00.120
I returned your girlfriend's shoe.

39:01.640 --> 39:03.840
Then, I'll thank you for him. Thank you.

39:05.200 --> 39:06.680
Can he thank me himself?

39:07.680 --> 39:09.840
Yes. He can only say,

39:10.920 --> 39:12.160
"Thank you."

39:13.280 --> 39:14.560
That works.

39:14.640 --> 39:16.480
You were passing by my place, right?

39:18.560 --> 39:20.320
Not really. I came for a visit.

39:20.400 --> 39:21.440
Visit for what?

39:23.080 --> 39:25.920
I wanted to ask if you have any
of Su Miao's belongings.

39:26.000 --> 39:29.120
Could you give Tang Qi a few as mementos?

39:29.200 --> 39:32.080
No, not at all. There's nothing left.
It's all been burned.

39:33.400 --> 39:35.960
Nothing at all? It's all been burned?

39:44.120 --> 39:46.240
Hello? You haven't handled it?

39:47.160 --> 39:48.320
You just found it?

39:48.400 --> 39:50.720
OK, keep it for now. I'll be right back.

39:54.320 --> 39:55.960
Every time I run into you,
I become really lucky.

39:56.040 --> 39:56.960
Thank you.

40:00.720 --> 40:01.920
Really lucky?

40:02.560 --> 40:04.280
They just found it?

40:18.640 --> 40:20.880
Hello? I checked it out.

40:20.960 --> 40:23.400
It's the stuff Su Miao used
for a poster shoot.

40:23.480 --> 40:25.240
It was supposed to be recycled,

40:25.320 --> 40:26.520
but because of the busy schedule,

40:26.600 --> 40:28.440
the colleague responsible for it
forgot about it.

40:28.520 --> 40:29.800
AMAZING DETECTIVE DI RENJIE

40:29.880 --> 40:30.720
Where is it then?

40:31.400 --> 40:33.040
Mr. Gu has sent it to Tang Qi's house.

40:38.040 --> 40:40.800
Things Su Miao used are things you used.

40:40.880 --> 40:42.760
There's your fingerprint on the cosmetics,

40:42.840 --> 40:44.560
your hair on the comb,

40:44.640 --> 40:46.920
and your DNA on the lipstick and cup.

40:47.000 --> 40:48.920
There are flaws everywhere.

40:51.360 --> 40:53.000
Don't scare me.

40:53.080 --> 40:55.000
Did you forget
what Tang Qi does for a living?

40:55.080 --> 40:57.960
Maybe one of his classmates
works in a lab.

40:58.040 --> 40:59.320
With one phone call from Tang Qi…

40:59.400 --> 41:00.800
Oh no.

41:00.880 --> 41:02.360
I just remembered something.

41:02.440 --> 41:03.840
If Tang Qi sees it,
he won't even need a lab

41:03.920 --> 41:05.320
to find out what's wrong.
